          "id": "d97b0afc65b172fe5522fd9bd5faab946e3a8598",
          "message": "v6.6.1 — CIRISVerify 5.2.0 → 5.3.0 coherence re-pin (for CIRISServer)\n\nAll three verify pins flip together (ciris-verify-core/ciris-crypto/\nciris-keyring + tpm/ios/android target tables) so the graph resolves to one\nciris_crypto — CIRISServer composes persist + verify in one process.\nAdditive on persist's side (no API change); full feature set + sqlite +\nlive-PG (1364 lib tests) green. 5.3.0 = the CEG 1.0-RC5 verification surface\nthe unblocked consent clauses (#146 Ask 5/6, #161 Ask 5) will consume next.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-14T10:56:25-05:00",
          "tree_id": "4561d054ac506766a5a06843ccc709130f02b549",
