          "id": "0d12e232339f604a77e8ffc030eef0bccd7d5e8e",
          "message": "v8.2.0 — §19 WholenessWitness corpus + verify-before-persist gate + WW→quorum-merge subordination + retention_decision/N6\n\nCEG 1.0-RC11 §19 (CIRISPersist#228 items 1-2,4-5 / #229 item 1). verify pin v5.9.0.\n\n- V085 (both backends): wholeness_witness_corpus, last-K per peer, no `verified` column (F-5), zero TimescaleDB.\n- put_wholeness_witness: PQC-verify-BEFORE-persist via verify_witness (hybrid gate + WW-2 namespace guard); classical-only → hard cut, zero rows on reject (AV-9).\n- build_local_witness: WW-2 leaf filter (drops anonymous-tier + cohort_scope:self) before compute_merkle_root.\n- reconcile_peer_witnesses: compare_witnesses → Equivocation retains + emits hard_case:witness_equivocation (never reconciles, N4); Divergent → TriggerQuorumMerge directive (witness does NOT decide — caller re-runs the EXISTING V058 resolve_monotonic_quorum/revision; no fragment-pick, no revoked-key resurrection); Consistent → no-op.\n- accept_if_monotonic + last_witness_epoch_for_peer: per-peer epoch anti-rollback (eclipse guard).\n- evict_fountain_content_by_consent + resolve_retention_action: retention_decision drives Withdrawn → hard_delete (revocation overrides rarity). N6 holding_claim_counts gate.\n- Excluded (edge-owned, CIRISEdge#144): SignedRelayCapacity/N8 + recursive-bootstrap SignedClaim. §19.7 aggregation = #230 follow-on.\n\nGate (plain postgres:16 + sqlite): clippy -D clean, fmt --check clean, nextest --all-targets 1306 passed / 0 failed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
