          "message": "v9.3.1 — re-pin CIRISVerify v6.6.0 -> v6.6.1 (wheel concurrence) (#254)\n\nv6.6.1 = identity-producer fix (decouple ML-DSA seal alias from recorded key_id\nin create_federation_identity, #89); none of persist's consumed surface touched.\nFamily-floor wheel-concurrence re-pin. No persist code change. Gate: clippy -D /\nfmt / nextest --all-targets 1565/0 on pg16+sqlite; no-backend combos clean.\nRequires-Dist floor stays >=6.0.0,<7. (#89 unblocks CIRISServer#45 USER path,\npairs with persist #247 node-half in v9.3.0.)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
